sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Patient as 👤 Patient<br/>ผู้ป่วย
    participant Omni as 🔐 Omnichannel<br/>Webhook Server<br/>(Port 3015)
    participant MCP as 🧠 OpenClaw<br/>MCP Server<br/>(Port 3016)
    participant Gemini as 🤖 Google<br/>Gemini AI
    participant GCS as 📦 Google<br/>Cloud Storage
    participant Doctor as 👨‍⚕️ Doctor Portal<br/>แพทย์

    Note over Patient,Doctor: 🔄 MCP SESSION LIFECYCLE<br/>วงจรชีวิตของ Session

    %% Session Creation
    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Patient,MCP: Phase 1: CREATE SESSION (สร้างเซสชั่น)
        Patient->>+Omni: Send first message via LINE/WhatsApp
        Omni->>Omni: Validate signature (HMAC-SHA256)
        Omni->>Omni: Check consent (PDPA)
        Omni->>+MCP: POST /mcp/ingest<br/>{patientId, channel, message}
        MCP->>MCP: createSession(patientId, channel)
        MCP->>GCS: Create patient bucket<br/>patients/{id}/session.json
        GCS-->>MCP: Session created ✅
        MCP-->>-Omni: Session initialized
        Omni-->>-Patient: ✅ ยินดีต้อนรับ
    end

    %% Update Context - Task 1
    rect rgb(255, 248, 225)
        Note over Patient,Doctor: Phase 2: TASK 1 - History Taking (ซักประวัติ)
        Patient->>+Omni: "มีไข้ 3 วัน ปวดหัว คลื่นไส้"
        Omni->>+MCP: POST /mcp/ingest<br/>{sessionId, message}
        MCP->>+Gemini: extractMedicalEntities(text)
        Gemini-->>-MCP: {symptoms: ["ไข้", "ปวดหัว", "คลื่นไส้"],<br/>duration: "3 days",<br/>vitalSigns: {}}
        MCP->>MCP: updateContext(sessionId, entities)
        MCP->>GCS: Write patients/{id}/hpi.json
        GCS-->>MCP: Context saved ✅
        MCP-->>Doctor: Socket.io: patient:context:updated
        MCP-->>-Omni: Updated context
        Omni-->>-Patient: "ขอบคุณ กรุณาระบุอุณหภูมิร่างกาย"
        Doctor->>+MCP: GET /mcp/context/{patientId}
        MCP-->>-Doctor: Full session context
    end

    %% Task 2 - Team Conference
    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over Doctor,GCS: Phase 3: TASK 2 - Team Conference (ปรึกษาทีม)
        Doctor->>+MCP: POST /mcp/team-brief/{patientId}<br/>{question, urgency}
        MCP->>GCS: Read full context
        GCS-->>MCP: Patient history + vitals + meds
        MCP->>+Gemini: generateTeamBrief(context)
        Gemini-->>-MCP: Brief summary (<500 words)
        MCP->>MCP: Post to Telegram care team group
        MCP-->>-Doctor: Consult sent ✅
    end

    %% Task 3 - Investigation
    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over Doctor,GCS: Phase 4: TASK 3 - Investigation Request (สั่งตรวจ)
        Doctor->>+MCP: POST /mcp/investigate/{patientId}<br/>{orders: ["CBC", "LFT"]}
        MCP->>MCP: updateContext(sessionId, {labOrders})
        MCP->>GCS: Write patients/{id}/lab_orders.json
        GCS-->>MCP: Saved ✅
        MCP->>Patient: "แพทย์สั่งตรวจ CBC, LFT<br/>กรุณาติดต่อห้องแล็บ"
        MCP-->>-Doctor: Lab orders created
    end

    %% Task 4 - Prescription
    rect rgb(255, 235, 238)
        Note over Doctor,Patient: Phase 5: TASK 4 - Prescription (สั่งยา)
        Doctor->>+MCP: POST /mcp/prescribe/{patientId}<br/>{medications: [...]}
        MCP->>+Gemini: generatePrescription(medications)
        Gemini-->>-MCP: Prescription draft + follow-up plan
        MCP->>GCS: Write patients/{id}/prescriptions.json
        GCS-->>MCP: Saved ✅
        MCP->>Patient: "คุณได้รับใบสั่งยา: [รายการยา]<br/>หากมีผลข้างเคียงกรุณาติดต่อ"
        MCP->>MCP: Schedule follow-up (T+24h, T+72h)
        MCP-->>-Doctor: Prescription sent ✅
    end

    %% Task 5 - Referral
    rect rgb(224, 247, 250)
        Note over Doctor,GCS: Phase 6: TASK 5 - Referral Package (ส่งต่อ)
        Doctor->>+MCP: POST /mcp/referral/{patientId}<br/>{facility, reason}
        MCP->>GCS: Read full context (history + labs + meds)
        GCS-->>MCP: Complete patient data
        MCP->>+Gemini: generateReferral(context)
        Gemini-->>-MCP: Referral letter (PDF-ready JSON)
        MCP->>GCS: Write patients/{id}/referral.json
        GCS-->>MCP: Saved ✅
        MCP->>Patient: "แพทย์ได้ส่งต่อเวชระเบียนของท่านแล้ว"
        MCP-->>-Doctor: Referral package ready for download
    end

    %% Session Archive/Delete
    rect rgb(236, 239, 241)
        Note over MCP,GCS: Phase 7: ARCHIVE or DELETE SESSION
        alt Appointment completed
            Doctor->>+MCP: POST /mcp/archiveSession/{patientId}
            MCP->>GCS: Move to long-term archive<br/>archive/{year}/{id}/
            GCS-->>MCP: Archived ✅
            MCP-->>-Doctor: Session archived
        else Patient revokes consent
            Patient->>+Omni: Revoke consent (PDPA)
            Omni->>+MCP: DELETE /mcp/context/{patientId}
            MCP->>GCS: Delete all patient data
            GCS-->>MCP: Deleted ✅
            MCP-->>-Omni: Session purged
            Omni-->>-Patient: ข้อมูลของท่านถูกลบแล้ว
        end
    end

    Note over Patient,Doctor: ✅ MCP SESSION COMPLETE<br/>เสร็จสิ้นวงจรการทำงาน
